l not likely be dragged under, unless the vessel is small, but it will stop dead in the water in 1 turn due to the drag. If a ship is grabbed and held by 8 or more tentacles, it will take damage as if rammed, and ships with water in their holds are easily dragged down to squids' lairs.", -- complete Monster Manual prose, verbatim
